// markdownlint configuration for `docs/design/`. It exists for ONE reason: to stop the MD040
// exemption in `docs/.markdownlint.jsonc` from reaching this directory by inheritance.
//
// markdownlint-cli2 reads the config nearest each linted file and walks upwards, so without this
// file every document here would silently pick up an exemption argued from a different corpus. The
// root of `docs/` fences measured output; this directory does not, or at least nobody has checked:
// the linter reports MD040 hits here against a large majority of fences that DO carry a language,
// and none of them has been read to decide which they are.
//
// Delete this file only after reading them. An exemption that arrives by inheritance is exactly the
// kind nobody notices was never argued.
{}
